'''Type 10''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained when beating any stage in [[Hometown Self-Defense Force Collaboration Event#Hometown Self-Defense Force|Hometown Self-Defense Force]] during the [[Hometown Self-Defense Force Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 54
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Type 10
|name2 = Cat Transportation Type 10
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat Transportation Type 10''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Type 10 is completely useless outside of [[Empire of Cats]]. It has a much cheaper cost than [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], in exchange for lower health and higher DPS, though this is negligible once Titan Cat's [[True Form]] is unlocked.

